  "description": "Jomox SunSyn Mk2 polysynth: the sound parameters of its MIDI implementation.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "SunSyn Mk2 MIDI Implementation",
      "notes": "The MIDI implementation's controller tables (PDF pages 1 - 4), read by tools/profiles/jomox/read-jomox-cc.mjs from SunSyn_MidiImplementation.pdf (sha256 819ee66ed1bfcafa22d2a54406b5d25b66c775cd8bc94e728688d48c702de773), https://www.jomox.de/upload/manuals/SunSyn_MidiImplementation.pdf, linked from https://www.jomox.de/support.php?lang=2&product_id=14. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/jomox/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/jomox/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the manual's MIDI implementation, sent as the controller it prints, on the channel variable. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "A value range named one each by the internal range beside it (`0/64  Off/On`) is a choice; values printed without names are a choice of those values; every other range is a number, its internal range or resolution in its description.",
    "Left out, actions: AllNoteOff (CC 123, 0..64).",
    "The table is read up to \"^Switch Controller CC 88\"; what follows is not rows of controllers."
  ],
  "variables": {
    "channel": 1
  },
  "coverage": {
    "singleParameterWrite": "complete-for-the-manual's-controller-tables: 49 parameters from 50 rows",
